<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ, our river, Christ, our water, springing from within;</l><l>Christ, our tree, and Christ, the fruits, to be enjoyed therein,</l><l>Christ, our day, and Christ, our light, and Christ, our morningstar:</l><l>Christ, our everything!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We are washing all our robes the tree of life to eat;</l><l>“O Lord, Amen, Hallelujah!”—Jesus is so sweet!</l><l>We our spirits exercise, and thus experience Christ.</l><l>What a Christ have we!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now we have a home so bright that outshines the sun,</l><l>Where the brothers all unite and truly are one.</l><l>Jesus gets us all together, Him we now display</l><l>In the local church.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
